  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The first release: the public API is promised, and follows semantic versioning, so a 1.x adds to it and changes none of it. Plays every English release ScummVM knows, from the title screen to the end: the Commodore 64 release and its demo, the 1987 DOS release and its demo, the 1988 DOS release, the American NES cartridge, the Atari ST and the Amiga; saves made in each load in ScummVM. Code written against 0.5.0-alpha builds and runs as it was; nothing has changed since it but the version.",
